            "review_title": "Review at Pho Suong",
            "review_text": "JJMayburg\nMargaret River, Australia385 contributions\n0\nIt isn't pho if it isn't tái and for breakfast\nFeb 2026 • Couples\nIf I had a dong for every bowl of chewy beef Pho, I'd be doing well. But not this place. Finally, when I asked for pho bo tai - with \"tai\" referring to the beef being rare, that was exactly what I got. My beef was delicately pink thin slices that \"finished\" cooking in the broth. Wonderfully tender and such a nice change from pre-cooked beef that is found in so many of the more tourist-accessible places. \n\nYou're giving up flavour if it isn't tai to start and make sure it is breakfast!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nAsk for \"tai\" - rare beef.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 11, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
