            "review_title": "Review at Pho Suong",
            "review_text": "Russ Lacuata\nLong Beach, California9995 contributions\n1\nA food lover's favorite\nAug 2024 • Solo\nDon't let the minimalist food stall scare you. It's a hole-in-the-wall type with limited seating. Located on an alley. Friendly and fast service. The family is said to have been making the same broth recipe for generations and definitely shows. The broth has its own natural sweetness with subtle cinnamon and star anise, the broth itself is worth coming for. \n\nEach bowl is topped with crispy fat beef, thinly sliced in big chunks. The beef is tender and succulent. Add picked garlic and chile peppers will definitely take it up a notch.\n\nA food lover's favorite from near and far.\nRead more\nWritten August 28, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
