            "review_text": "nguyen hung a\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nPHO\nFeb 2024 • Family\nLocated in the heart of the city, this restaurant is a culinary gem. The menu is a delightful blend of traditional and innovative dishes, but it's the pho that truly steals the show. The broth is rich and flavorful, with just the right balance of spices. The noodles are perfectly cooked, and the meat is tender and succulent. Each bite is a symphony of flavors that leaves you craving more. The service is impeccable, and the ambiance is warm and inviting. Whether you're a pho aficionado or trying it for the first time, this restaurant is a must-visit. It's no wonder it's a local favorite and a destination for food lovers from near and far.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\ncheap and delicious\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 28, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
