            "review_text": "JIntorcio\nNorth Reading, Massachusetts72 contributions\n0\nDon't Be Afraid\nFeb 2023\nDon't let the minimalist facility scare you off. The staff was friendly and helpful and the Pho was amazing! The family is said to have been making broth for generations and it shows. With subtle cinnamon and star anise flavors, the broth itself was worth coming for. We tried the headlining Beef Pho at a rediculous $3 USD. Adding the pickled garlic and chile peppers found on the table took the dish to a whole new level. This is can't miss!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 20, 2023",
